1", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65397209_1645641832894674_7853497919645059059_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U4RZ3uNl_MwQ7kNvwFYOVQG&_nc_oc=AdpiLguzK2pvugZsq06SnlHM17RAb096AiDVTbc0XyzXGmDUcNLaSPTB-sUc6HeXy10&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRnYYn2JSc5Ok4mMo-Hum1ThS569F2Saw6TyuJ74JJRHQ&oe=6AFEFE65"}, {"file_name": "DFRF (2) (1).png", "id": "1176875830402568", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86796482_1176875833735901_6466333344444458420_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9_Pum6gbezgQ7kNvwE90uCt&_nc_oc=AdpztrjY2wzkwkwzQ6e0V2lKMOEbXr-Qdj2GiPVTBypZipWfarrRGqR2_nPKiEPVWok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSGnWHH11n_nGYZyvBG8BVCEZPt4Ja8c3OsRsbkbH6XBA&oe=6AFF30ED"}, {"file_name": "DFRF (2) (1).png", "id": "834399874779444", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974733_834399878112777_3696016832261689858_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N51QoZZqOXoQ7kNvwGHiESB&_nc_oc=AdqPyZOYlVhU3I_CCAFLhlZuwDzNud0TsX2T6OHnHlwy7SLnqiXl7iM255QGa2oIX3o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQmM3JYOs8z2c4cHrRPD40_r1KLVAtKfqFnCn7ViusOOA&oe=6AFF2FC4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "DFRF (2) (1).png", "id": "7937188119653093", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75326678_7937188136319758_3777017794538859455_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ibvReYo17voQ7kNvwGpbQNi&_nc_oc=Adpyjq4gTv5rkDdFAXU6WabLbEY3nOGpfHE-ZCsrsl9KL_1GhMPQ53copdJU1F-7mDc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQWdBhASeCp74szBMrmU9DSF__aCHCQXkHxXKGdJcBSug&oe=6AFF2545"}, "display_name": "Roblox taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Game Description: Roblox Taggers\nTitle: Roblox Taggers\n\nGenre: Action, Casual, Multiplayer\n\nPlatform: vr\n\nDeveloper: hellovr1\n\n\n\nOverview\nRoblox Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Goeill a Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer runs out. Runners must avoid being tagged and use the environment and power-ups to outmaneuver the Taggers.\n\nGame Modes:\n\nClassic Tag: Traditional tag mode where Taggers must tag all Runners to win.\nInfected Tag: Tagged players become Taggers, spreading the infection until only one Runner remains.\nFreeze Tag: Tagged players are frozen in place until a teammate unfreezes them. Taggers win by freezing all players.\nMaps:\n\nUrban Playground: Navigate through a bustling cityscape with rooftops, alleys, and parks.\nEnchanted Forest: A magical forest filled with hiding spots and mystical creatures.\nSpace Station: A futuristic environment with zero-gravity zones and space-themed obstacles.\nPower-Ups:\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Roblox Taggers is a dynamic and exciting game on the Roblox platform, inspired by the classic playground game of tag. In this game, players are divided into two groups: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' objective is to chase and tag as many Runners as possible within a set time limit, while the Runners aim to avoid getting tagged. The game features various maps with obstacles and hiding spots, adding strategic depth and fun to the chase. Power-ups and special abilities can be collected to gain a"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://robloxtaggers.pages.dev/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "H3LLOVR1", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/robloxrunners/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "8091274210903866"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "453412463990652"}]}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1720661400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "453412463990652"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "8771877769510170", "version": "1.1.111"}, "id": "1004387801207123", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8000305343334087", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "8771877769510170"}, "release_status": "SCHEDULED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1004387801207123"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1729032680, "id": "8771877769510170", "version": "1.1.111", "version_code": 9012, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__ty